<font color=ffffff><li>Please use EST for all submissions for the sake of consistency.
<li>Reservable mobs/zones include: Hate, Fear, Air, Growth, Naggy, Vox, and the Chardok Nobles/Royals.
<li>When adding an event please include Guild Name and Raid in the first line and hit "continue and save".
<li>On the second page please submit a starting time and choose your date "mm/dd/yyyy".
<li>Once you hit the "save" button the submission is automatically posted on the calendar.
<li>Then use the drop down menu to return to the main calendar.  
<li>Please adhere to the calendar rules when posting raids.
<b><li>If there are raid conflicts: please email <a href=mailto:azmokar@hotmail.com>Azmokar</a> with the <i>guild names and the raid</i> and the logs will be checked for verification.  This process can take up to 48 hours.  We encourage comprimises, but will intervene when asked.  In the event logs are pulled, it is then the final word on all conflicts and the results will be posted in the schedule forum. It is the obligation of the offending party to rechedule their raid at a non conflicting time.</b><p> 
